    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:165b4d571aff709ce4249b7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呀～能一路坚持跑到今天真是太棒辣～\r\n没想到居然能在这场梦之大赛里，在特等席尽情\r\n瞻仰马娘酱们的英姿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a0fcd598b38c7f29a8cf349d2f607a82f2895d8c9924e8775c630880ae48f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96be8ba82156d32179aec756",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『爱丽数码』。\r\n草地与沙土在她眼中毫无差别，\r\n是位最喜欢赛马娘的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a080ba15e779992709610bf0639dc5b542583751f4b27c8931f4467ef48e8e1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b8c116c6990a9698d40dadb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道爱丽数码身上的什么地方吸引了新\r\n宇宙的注意……但总之，新宇宙似乎也很在意她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b207ce5030111a200452a239532bc325b3ba0809383a0272cdfb2602c3d91578",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c6557b0ff3aa09140e81d43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
