    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a04fa8cc3de4fdf901e63960",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『宝冢纪念』……真厉害呢……\r\n七色的“引力”与“斥力”相互影响……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9c5b2675dad4c77027686afa4c9aa85277f5e748206eb2e805a88d0b3fa055",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6db6bf6d6454f1bb1f088d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是什么人都会追求刺激。\r\n——哪怕是新宇宙也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06536292968eae4e3eeb736a665b8e5928e85e427d4e7d07d00885cfd7436088",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
