    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f744dd5ae010072a45d8b21d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——“群星的飨宴”。\r\n今日，新宇宙就要迈向这未知的外宇宙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d876525a75217d7274592536938a51c22792b2d4598457565048a9b5368e42c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
