    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4beb4a2d2f3bf795c2a2f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与迄今为止——不一样了呢。\r\n“同行者”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245c72c71f4a84afc20164e5a74561d22c716bfdf2800fea6f25cda9e0b1178e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9607bbd21f053fc728929efd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这古马级豪强亦齐聚的比赛之中，\r\n我们也见到了不少与经典级选手气场完全不同\r\n的参赛者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dee0690b93d91367e80b17dfd80a6fbdcfad375faa01ab9fbe4fed8b1a427e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef143e5ea4f8e5b2eafc6b20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而其中最具代表的则是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8b6a9564627105073425258c1da2e0a6ded0da47c9bbf833486aa79c4e67a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
