      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aeb9909229472c4eefc66ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a0f36db3e54f4e2fa022c8d29dd07a8f024a475cae2ddfb01ad1c1967834f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d09a19aad48e8d9557b209",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春秋大奖赛连霸——\r\n必将完成这一任务。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0865848f70459a5f06f11ba5175b76612a708b627636a7bba99e68ec5b48893",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc36c5e5d99f0cc08ef36ba8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她就是去年的年度代表赛马娘。\r\n人称“冷彻的执行者”，『吉兆』。\r\n以及——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d7daf43539ba0e3b807a6165afa3572545aea5b81c2432c996a4a1082339769",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab3538538d8acca28286f22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跳舞城",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bf9caa1bd6feae669b1e488e23eb4a60b2efc2d8557812947faf359faf3d8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f59d07a165bdf54f58a0e55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是要为我们献上一区勇猛的踢踏舞吗！\r\n冠军们——以及向冠军们发起挑战的新星！",
