      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后是会与新宇宙共同前进，还是分别。\r\n那分歧点，说的应该正是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69607288ac34c5ea4263763292b331f97ca2824584e1b1c177dc52a6f5bedbf2",
